%% RazorApp XR overview diagram
%% Paste this file into https://mermaid.live/

flowchart TD
    XR[RazorApp XR\nexample.com/v1alpha1] --> COMP[Crossplane Composition\nKCL pipeline]

    COMP --> SA[ServiceAccount\nprojectName-sa]
    COMP --> DEPLOY[Deployment\nfrontend]

    COMP --> DB[provider-sql Database\nprojectName-db]
    COMP --> URO[provider-sql User\nprojectName-readonly-user]
    COMP --> URW[provider-sql User\nprojectName-readwrite-user]
    COMP --> GRO[Grant\nreadonly CONNECT, SELECT]
    COMP --> GRW[Grant\nreadwrite CREATE TABLE,\nALTER, CONNECT, SELECT,\nINSERT, UPDATE]

    DB --> URO
    DB --> URW
    URO --> GRO
    URW --> GRW

    URO --> SRO[Kubernetes Secret\nprojectName-readonly-user-secret]
    URW --> SRW[Kubernetes Secret\nprojectName-readwrite-user-secret]

    COMP --> VPUSH[Vault Policy\nprojectName-eso-push-policy]
    COMP --> VTOKEN[Vault Token\nprojectName-eso-token]
    VPUSH --> VTOKEN

    COMP --> SSV[ESO SecretStore\nVault via token auth]
    VTOKEN --> SSV

    COMP --> PSRO[PushSecret\npush ro user to Vault]
    COMP --> PSRW[PushSecret\npush rw user to Vault]

    SRO --> PSRO
    SRW --> PSRW
    SSV --> PSRO
    SSV --> PSRW

    PSRO --> VRO[Vault KV\nprojects/projectName/database/ro-user]
    PSRW --> VRW[Vault KV\nprojects/projectName/database/rw-user]

    COMP --> VREAD[Vault Policy\nprojectName-app-read-policy]
    COMP --> VAUTH[Vault Kubernetes Auth Role\nprojectName-app]
    SA --> VAUTH
    VREAD --> VAUTH

    COMP --> SSA[ESO SecretStore\nVault via Kubernetes auth]
    VAUTH --> SSA
    SA --> SSA

    COMP --> ESRO[ExternalSecret\ncreates database-user-ro]
    COMP --> ESRW[ExternalSecret\ncreates database-user-rw]

    SSA --> ESRO
    SSA --> ESRW
    VRO --> ESRO
    VRW --> ESRW

    ESRO --> APPSRO[Kubernetes Secret\ndatabase-user-ro]
    ESRW --> APPSRW[Kubernetes Secret\ndatabase-user-rw]

    APPSRO --> DEPLOY
    DEPLOY --> POD[App Pod\nenvFrom secretRef]
